{"id":"438135","name":"黄豆猪蹄汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/438135/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄豆","amount":"100克"},{"name":"猪蹄","amount":"415克"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：黄豆（已泡发）。","img":"images/438135/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪蹄（已清洗焯水）。","img":"images/438135/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香葱。","img":"images/438135/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将已泡发的黄豆淘洗一下，放入高压锅里，合入焯好的猪蹄。","img":"images/438135/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"接着，倒入清水，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/438135/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上盖用中小火烧煮15分钟后关火。","img":"images/438135/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后，焖至没气后开盖，加适量的盐、鸡精调味搅匀。","img":"images/438135/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"最后，出锅后撒上香葱，即成。","img":"images/438135/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}